Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

OSINT Copilot modifies Tangent by rebranding the application and adding an
open-source investigation toolset on top of its note-writing workspace. The
substantive additions live primarily under:

  apps/tangent-electron/src/osint/**       renderer investigation features
  apps/tangent-electron/src/main/osint/**  privileged investigation services

They include an entity and relationship model persisted as Markdown, schema
support, graph/timeline/map/canvas views, optional local CLI-driven AI tools,
guarded enrichers, skills, task agents, and a paired browser extension.

Parts of the investigation layer originated in the OSINT Copilot plugin for
Obsidian. The copyright holders release the code included in this repository
under Apache-2.0. Files derived from Tangent retain their original copyright;
the repository history identifies integration and rebranding modifications.

